			"notes": "GTBS 1.1.1 brings the legacy and modern builds back into feature parity, expands the Preview editor, and hardens game tracking around nick changes, disconnects, localized scoreboards, and skipped builders.\n\nPublished JARs:\n- 1.8.9 Forge\n- 1.21.10-1.21.11 Fabric\n- 1.21.10-1.21.11 Forge\n- 26.1 Fabric\n- 26.2 Fabric\n\nThe 26.1 and 26.2 Forge source trees remain in the repository for reference and source maintenance only; their JARs are intentionally not published. GTBS 1.1.1 is the final version that includes 26.x Forge source, and those targets are discontinued after this version. See CHANGELOG.md for the full notes."
